@startuml
' reviewmesh — CUC-2 "Verify environment readiness (doctor)" activity diagram. Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/activity-doctor.puml
title Verify environment readiness — doctor / preflight (CUC-2)
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Detect available adapters\n(probe each detect command);
:Resolve roles -> adapters -> models\n(defaults + overrides);
:Check adapter binaries present/resolvable (per selected lane)\n(auth-state check = target/future);
:Validate model profiles (catalog resolves);
:Check surface capabilities (read/write, diff, artifact dir);
if (--probe?) then (yes)
  :Safe <binary> --version check (no model call)\n(live model-identity verification = target/future);
else (no)
endif
if (all checks pass?) then (yes)
  :Announce resolved role -> adapter -> model mapping;
  :Proceed (or report ready);
  stop
else (no)
  :Report the specific failure\n(e.g. "re-run <cli> login") & halt;
  stop
endif
@enduml
